# Secrets for roke: loaded after roke.env and passed to the box as
# environment variables. Listed in .gitignore, so it is never committed.
#
# Provider API keys are only needed if you don't log in from inside the
# agent (the login prompt in Claude Code, codex login --device-auth for
# Codex, /connect in OpenCode); that login
# is stored in the project's home volume instead.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
